{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15463","headline":"江上逢柳中庸 · 李端","name":"江上逢柳中庸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧住衡山曾夜归，见君江客忆荆扉。\n星沉岭上人行早，月过湖西鹤唳稀。\n弱竹万株频碍帻，新泉数步一褰衣。\n今来唯有禅心在，乡路翻成向翠微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}